### RGB Color Mixer ###
An interactive RGB color controller built with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and GSAP.
Users can mix Red, Green, and Blue channels, preview the resulting color in real time,
save their favorite colors, and copy RGB or HEX codes with a single click.

### Features ###
- Adjust Red, Green, and Blue channels individually
- Live color preview updates in real time
- Copy RGB or HEX values to clipboard
- Save colors to a Favorites Palette (stored in localStorage)
- Automatically track recently used colors
- Hold-to-increment for smooth slider control
- Subtle GSAP animations for better user experience
- Fully responsive layout for desktop, tablet, and mobile

### Technical Overview ###
- Modular JavaScript structure (no frameworks)
- GSAP used for animation of color items and header transitions
- DRY principle applied across rendering and event handling functions
- LocalStorage used for persisting user data (favorites + history)
- Split project files for maintainability:
    /index.html  
    /css/style.css  
    /js/script.js  
    /assets/screenshots/


### Built With ###
- HTML5
- CSS3
- Vanilla JavaScript (ES6)
- GSAP 3

